# UltrON v1.0.6 — Daily CSV File Reader

## What This Does

UltrON already has a `csv` protocol that reads a **fixed file path**. The v1.0.6 feature upgrades this to support **daily rotating CSV files** — where each day's data is in a separate file in a folder, with a date-based filename pattern. New rows are appended every minute.

### Reference CSV Format (from image)
```
Row 1: Header (skipped)
Row 2+: Data rows  
  Column A (0) → timestamp  e.g. "5/27/2026 0:02"
  Column B (1) → Parameter 1  (12.2)
  Column C (2) → Parameter 2  (6.4)
  Column D (3) → Parameter 3  (30.5)
  Column E (4) → Parameter 4  (25)
```

