### CSV Watcher — Daily file resolution

#### [MODIFY] [csv_watcher.py](file:///c:\Users\sunsh\OneDrive\Music\UltrON\client\backend\ultron_backend\app\services\csv_watcher.py)
- New `DailyCSVWatcher` class that:
  - Takes `folder` + `filename_pattern` (date format string)
  - Resolves today's file path automatically each poll
  - Falls back to yesterday's file if today's doesn't exist yet (e.g. at midnight)
  - Reads the **last row** (most recent minute)
  - Column mapping: `register_address` = column index (0=A, 1=B, 2=C…)
  - Timestamp col = 0 (column A) by default
  - Skips row 1 (header), reads from row 2

