## Filename Pattern Format

Will support these date tokens in the pattern:
| Token | Example | Result |
|---|---|---|
| `{YYYYMMDD}` | `{YYYYMMDD}.csv` | `20260618.csv` |
| `{YYYY-MM-DD}` | `{YYYY-MM-DD}.csv` | `2026-06-18.csv` |
| `{DD-MM-YYYY}` | `data_{DD-MM-YYYY}.csv` | `data_18-06-2026.csv` |
| `{DDMMYYYY}` | `{DDMMYYYY}.csv` | `18062026.csv` |

User just types the pattern in the UI — the system resolves it daily.

